Two baselines derive from third-party work and remain subject to their upstream
licenses and copyright:

  stc_rgcn/baselines/gmel.py
      A single-file consolidation of the open-source GMEL implementation
      (https://github.com/jackmiemie/GMEL), from Liu et al., AAAI 2020,
      "Learning Geo-Contextual Embeddings for Commuting Flow Prediction".
      The data pipeline was replaced with project adapters and the GBRT
      fine-tuning stage was removed.

  stc_rgcn/baselines/sigcn.py
      A PyTorch re-implementation of SI-GCN, from Yao et al., 2020, "Spatial
      Origin-Destination Flow Imputation Using Graph Convolutional Neural
      Networks". The upstream reference code
      (https://github.com/susurrant/flow-imputation) is TensorFlow 1.x.

The gravity, radiation and tree-ensemble baselines, and everything else in this
repository, were written for this project.
